Description: DMS Greeter for greetd (git nightly)
 DMS Greeter is a greetd login screen with the Dux Shell aesthetic.
 This is the nightly/git version built from the latest master branch.
 A single Go binary with the Quickshell UI embedded; the UI is extracted
 to the greeter cache directory at startup.
 .
 Supports multiple compositors including Niri, Hyprland, and Sway with
 session selection, user authentication, and dynamic theming synced from
 Dux Shell.
 .
 Conflicts with the stable dux-greeter package; both install
 /usr/bin/dms-greeter.

